:: day-1_kitchen [nobr]
<<locationImage "kitchens" "Palace Kitchens">>
<h2>🍞 Palace Kitchens</h2>
<p>The output is staggering. Marta is baking like the world is ending. She might not be wrong.</p>

<<completeObjective "visit_kitchen_d1">>

<<if $d2_npc_marta and not $d1_npc_marta2>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <<npcPortrait "marta" "Marta">>
  <h4>👩‍🍳 Crisis Tempo</h4>
  <p>Bread in three varieties. Two soups. A cake usually reserved for state occasions.</p>
  [[Sit|day-1_npc_marta2]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if not $d2_npc_marta or $d1_npc_marta2>>
  <p class="empty-note">The kitchen churns on regardless. Heat, steam, the clatter of a palace feeding itself through a crisis.</p>
<</if>>

